<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="r7HGkfUdJ4owWvY-YRPf">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1144" dy="691" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="bVcTVYIVmwyQ1-2vkQ1w-1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontColor=default;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Observabality&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;There are 3 main signlas that we need to consider&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Logs/Events - Recors the events that happened over time - &lt;b&gt;structured logs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Matrics - Numbers describing a process or activity over a period of time - &lt;b&gt;Matrices API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Traces - Data that shows, for each invocation of a downstream service, which instanace was called, which method within that instance was invoked, how request was performed. - &lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Traces API&amp;nbsp; .&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;mark class=&quot;act acu af&quot; style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-size: 20px; box-sizing: inherit; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;Traces are also known as &lt;/mark&gt;&lt;mark class=&quot;act acu af&quot; style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-size: 20px; box-sizing: inherit; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;sn&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit;&quot;&gt;distributed traces&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;mark class=&quot;act acu af&quot; style=&quot;font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-size: 20px; box-sizing: inherit; cursor: pointer;&quot;&gt;. They traverse network, process, and security boundaries, to give you a holistic view of your system.&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;279e&quot; class=&quot;pt oi if z oj pu pv ao on pw px aq or nu py pz qa ny qb qc qd oc qe qf qg qh cv&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 1.72em 0px -0.31em; font-family: sohne, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;The Magic of Auto-Instrumentation (The Easy Way)&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sohne, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: -0.016em;&quot;&gt;Spans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;aee4&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph pz qa ke qb b qc rq qe qf qg rr qi qj fm rs ql qm fp rt qo qp fs ru qr qs qt ir cv&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0.94em 0px -0.46em; word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;A Span represents a unit of work. They can be thought of as the work being done during an operation’s execution.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;aee4&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph pz qa ke qb b qc rq qe qf qg rr qi qj fm rs ql qm fp rt qo qp fs ru qr qs qt ir cv&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0.94em 0px -0.46em; word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;aee4&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph pz qa ke qb b qc rq qe qf qg rr qi qj fm rs ql qm fp rt qo qp fs ru qr qs qt ir cv&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0.94em 0px -0.46em; word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:875/1*L0TX12i3IISH9kjpjHfaLw.png&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;e84b&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph pz qa ke qb b qc qd qe qf qg qh qi qj fm qk ql qm fp qn qo qp fs qq qr qs qt ir cv&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Logs represent occurrences at a specific point in time. Events aren’t that much more useful, other than being easier to read and query. The problem is that in isolation, Events don’t really tell a story. What if instead, we captured info for &lt;span class=&quot;qb kf&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;a given block of time&lt;/span&gt; (i.e. a time span)?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;e84b&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph pz qa ke qb b qc qd qe qf qg qh qi qj fm qk ql qm fp qn qo qp fs qq qr qs qt ir cv&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;e84b&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph pz qa ke qb b qc qd qe qf qg qh qi qj fm qk ql qm fp qn qo qp fs qq qr qs qt ir cv&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; font-family: source-serif-pro, Georgia, Cambria, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1150" width="880" x="10" y="10" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
